{
  "tema": 5055,
  "slug": "condicional-querer",
  "titulo": "Conjugate querer in the conditional",
  "subtitulo": "Querría, querrías, querríamos: the future stem querr- with the conditional endings.",
  "foto": "t10.jpg",
  "regla": "Querer has the irregular stem querr- in the conditional, with the regular endings: querría, querrías, querría, querríamos, querrían.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Querer** (_to want_) is irregular in the conditional (**el condicional simple**). It uses the same irregular stem as the future, **querr-**, and the regular conditional endings."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "**querr-**",
            "**-ía, -ías, -ía, -íamos, -ían**"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "querer"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "querría"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "querrías"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "querría"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "querríamos"
            ],
            [
              "ustedes, ellos",
              "querrían"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Querer** is irregular in the future, so it's irregular in the conditional too: it uses the same stem **querr-**, with **double r**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Every form has a written accent on the **í** of the ending."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: hear the double **r** roll: **que-rrrí-a**. One **r** is the past; two is _would_."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "¿==Querrías== estar en su lugar?",
              "en": "Would you like to be in his place?"
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Querría== él tocar para nosotros?",
              "en": "Would he like to play for us?"
            },
            {
              "es": "No ==querríamos== pagar más.",
              "en": "We wouldn't want to pay more."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ellos ==querrían== un mundo mejor para sus hijos.",
              "en": "They'd want a better world for their kids."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ustedes ==querrían== ser más altos.",
              "en": "You'd like to be taller."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "pares",
          "lista": [
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "Quereríamos ir."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Querríamos ir."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "The **e** disappears and the **rr** stays."
            },
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Quería ir. (I wanted to go)"
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Querría ir. (I would like to go)"
                }
              ],
              "nota": "One **r**, **quería**, is the imperfect. Double **r**, **querría**, is the conditional. Listen for the roll."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
